0 26 120 [
[(The 'write' message takes a filename to save to and one or more arrays \050one)]
[(for each channel\051. Note that both 'read' and 'write' messages can expand)]
[("~" to the home directory.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 26 216 [
[(A 'read' message takes a filename and zero or any nymber of arrays to load)]
[(it into \050one for each channel\051. The number of channels of the soundfile)]
[(need not match the number of arrays given to read \050extras channels are)]
[(dropped and unsupplied channels are zeroed out in the extra arrays\051. If you)]
[(don't supply any array, no samples are actually read but you still get the)]
[(output with the file's number of samples and other info.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
